  partName: Crankcase
  description: The Crankcase, located at the middle-center-center of the Hover Engine,
    is a large and complex-shaped component that houses the engine's crankshaft,
    bearings, and other critical components. Made of standardSurface2 material, it
    provides a strong and durable foundation for the engine's operation. Notably,
    the Crankcase's design and material selection play a critical role in maintaining
    the engine's lubrication system, thermal management, and overall structural integrity.
